### Balderdash API walkthrough (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)
### Run `pnpm dev` first. Cookies are kept by the client between requests, so
### use separate "cookie jars" (or curl -c/-b) for the host and each player.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@code = KQWZ

### 1. Host creates a game (sets bd_<CODE> host cookie). Copy the code into @code.
POST {{base}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "words": [
    { "word": "Snollygoster", "definition": "A shrewd, unprincipled person, especially a politician." },
    { "word": "Bumfuzzle", "definition": "To confuse or fluster." }
  ],
  "settings": { "correctGuessPoints": 2 }
}

### 2. Public snapshot
GET {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}

### 3. A player joins (sets a player cookie in *this* client's jar)
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/join
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ann" }

### 4. Player private view
GET {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/me

### 5. Host view (needs the host cookie)
GET {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/host

### 6. Host starts (needs 2+ players)
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "START" }

### 7. Player submits
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "SUBMIT", "text": "A kind of hat worn by canal workers." }

### 8. Host: stop waiting -> REVIEW, then open voting
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "STOP_WAITING" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "OPEN_VOTING" }

### 9. Player votes (take an option id from the snapshot)
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "VOTE", "optionId": "o_xxxx" }

### 10. Host: reveal, scoreboard, next
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "REVEAL_NOW" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "SHOW_SCOREBOARD" }

###
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "NEXT_ROUND" }

### Heartbeat
POST {{base}}/api/games/{{code}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "HEARTBEAT" }
